From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] [unit] Add radio caps transaction test

Runs the capability switch of binder_radio_caps.c against a fake
radio: one complete transaction, and the cases where setDataAllowed,
deactivateDataCall or setRadioCapability (START or the FINISH of an
abort) can't be submitted.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/mer-hybris/ofono-binder-plugin/pull/85]
